{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"2cb939f002e0d161","x":-213,"y":-100,"width":250,"height":119,"type":"text","text":"Arzen gives fragment Bloodstone to Kasayt's Cult"},
		{"id":"4cf17e5adf4f4cb3","x":100,"y":-100,"width":250,"height":119,"type":"text","text":"Use of Bloodstone begins to awaken the Stone King"},
		{"id":"52a16d04b6930308","x":420,"y":-120,"width":250,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"Stone King awakening triggers Ivys' defense, and activated Graveglass"},
		{"id":"3db1e65bee7a9fa7","x":760,"y":-172,"width":250,"height":265,"type":"text","text":"Graveglass within Ivys' fortress, studies the Stone King and Kairos, starts to agree with Kairos after seeing the state of the world post Reshaping"},
		{"id":"90a30c984c7b764b","x":935,"y":137,"width":250,"height":298,"type":"text","text":"In anger Arzen is manipulated by Sathu-Dara. Arzen tells The Acolyte of Kasayt where to find Rowan and that Rowan his information on the Stone King"},
		{"id":"b49b2ab1b68f7db5","x":295,"y":186,"width":250,"height":199,"type":"text","text":"Arzen hunts for Emrys (doesn't know who Finch is), his lover which he calls Min Jadid, The Reborn"},
		{"id":"73650ea3ce1553b1","x":615,"y":170,"width":250,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"Arzen reaches out to Rowan (old friend) to ask bout Min Jadid, Rowan knows something but won't tell Arzen"},
		{"id":"4f89eaaea05622b1","x":-705,"y":169,"width":250,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"Khal Daraan (through Sathu-Dara) whispers in Arzen's ear about the location of the Bloodstone, Arzen follows the visions"},
		{"id":"284c2a6b65bc9c1c","x":-335,"y":205,"width":250,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"Sathu-Dara communes to Arzen secrets on how to see his true soul"},
		{"id":"f1ef9194173108be","x":-15,"y":169,"width":250,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"Arzen finds ancient prison of Kronos beneath Walima, uses the power there to do the Sacrament of Oblivion"},
		{"id":"b5ce14071fe893ae","x":615,"y":-436,"width":250,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"The Acolyte (Hartwyn) / Cult of Kasayt hunt the Stone King to make Kasayt a new God using its demonic power"},
		{"id":"7f0db8787407666f","x":141,"y":480,"width":309,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"Arzen's communion + Sacrament of Oblivion opens a rift in the Infinite Road, which the Ur-Daraan invade, ending up on the Moon Nysria"},
		{"id":"835af6b23613d2f2","x":670,"y":517,"width":232,"height":159,"type":"text","text":"The Ur-Daraan make war on the Star-Elves, clashing for control of the Moon"},
		{"id":"34c02a7bf2f17ec0","x":-1320,"y":481,"width":401,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"The Ur-Daraan are born, for thousands of years they war with all creations that have stopped existing. The devour and grow strong. They are trapped in the Deep with Khal Daraan, unable to escape"},
		{"id":"c38f5bb94bac830d","x":-520,"y":-100,"width":220,"height":119,"type":"text","text":"Kasayt sealed (This was the first point in this note lol)"},
		{"id":"9680041741273c90","x":1081,"y":712,"width":359,"height":232,"type":"text","text":"Sathu-Dara builds Ur-Mesharan, The Spire of Whispers, a tower that was built by Ivys for Nysria, claimed by the Ur-Daraan. Her fortress where she projects her tricks and lies to the mortals of Terra-Oblivia"},
		{"id":"4febdc7fdf1254f4","x":1565,"y":516,"width":210,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"Orzul slays Nysria, ending the leaving all Star-Elves on Nysria dead."},
		{"id":"1d875e8cdeff154e","x":-1000,"y":-33,"width":217,"height":170,"type":"text","text":"- Where was the bloodstone?\n- How did it get there?"},
		{"id":"3e078e10f3ed678d","x":1740,"y":-555,"width":250,"height":119,"type":"text","text":"Cult of Kasayt Campaign begins here!"},
		{"id":"4c6ad9ceff6888fe","x":1360,"y":-575,"width":250,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"The Acolyte sends Sana to kill Rowan, and get the information on the Stone King"},
		{"id":"21c860d21ac0c0cf","x":1235,"y":121,"width":250,"height":331,"type":"text","text":"The Acolyte turns on Arzen, revealing his location to a group of heretic hunters. Arzen is forced to flee into the desert with his Old Rites magic and heretical practices made public"},
		{"id":"6ce3f167657f0da2","x":1920,"y":154,"width":333,"height":265,"type":"text","text":"Graveglass and Arzen study Kairos's life together, and make a pact. Arzen gets time magic and Graveglass vows to work together to set the world back to the way it was supposed to be, and undo the Reshaping."},
		{"id":"579accfe14ca0394","x":1565,"y":105,"width":250,"height":364,"type":"text","text":"Graveglass and Arzen are connected by Sathu-Dara, making Arzen believe they were both contacted by Khal Daraan. Arzen travels to a Chronovault in Walima and meets with Graveglass"}
	],
